   "tip": {
    "title": "Place first, question last",
    "text": "To ask \"Where is X?\", say the place first and put କେଉଁଠି at the end: ଷ୍ଟେସନ କେଉଁଠି? You can add ଅଛି (\"is\"): ଶୌଚାଳୟ କେଉଁଠି ଅଛି? Question words in Odia usually sit just before the verb, not at the start of the sentence as in English."
   }
