   "tip": {
    "title": "-କୁ \"to\" and -ରେ \"at\"",
    "text": "Odia uses endings where English uses prepositions. -କୁ means \"to/towards\": ଡାହାଣକୁ, ବାମକୁ. -ରେ means \"at/in\": ଛକରେ, ପାଖରେ. Words like ପାଖରେ and ପଛରେ come after the noun: ବଜାର ପାଖରେ = \"next to the market\" (lit. market near-at)."
   }
